[
  {
    "content_id": "10035001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;以下是哈巴谷先知得到的啟示。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊， 我要向你呼救到何時， 你才垂聽呢？ 暴虐橫行，我向你呼求到何時， 你才肯拯救？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你為何讓我目睹罪惡？ 你為何對邪惡坐視不理？ 我眼前盡是毀滅和暴力， 到處是紛爭和衝突。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;因此律法失效， 正義不彰， 惡人包圍義人， 正義被扭曲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;耶和華說：「你們環顧列國， 仔細察看， 必驚奇不已， 因為我要在你們的時代行一件事， 即使有人告訴你們，你們也不會相信。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我要使兇殘、暴虐的迦勒底人興起。 他們要席捲天下， 強佔別人的家園。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;他們任意妄為， 令人膽戰心驚。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;「他們的馬比豹子還快， 比夜間的豺狼還猛。 他們的騎兵從遠方飛馳而來， 如鷹撲食。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;他們殘暴成性， 像狂風一樣撲來， 抓獲的俘虜多如塵沙。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;他們嘲笑君王，譏諷首領， 對一切堅城嗤之以鼻， 修築高臺將其攻取。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;這些罪人如狂風橫掃而過， 他們奉自己的力量為神明。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;耶和華， 我的上帝，我的聖者啊， 你從亙古就存在， 你永不消逝。 耶和華啊，你派迦勒底人來審判； 磐石啊，你立他們作施罰者。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你的眼目極為清潔， 見不得邪惡， 也不能容忍罪惡。 但你為何容忍奸惡之人呢？ 惡人吞滅比他們公義的人， 你為何默然不語呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你為何使人像海裡的魚， 像沒有首領的爬蟲呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;迦勒底人用鉤子鉤住他們， 用漁網網住他們， 用拖網把他們聚在一起， 並因此而歡喜快樂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35001016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;迦勒底人向漁網獻祭， 向漁網燒香， 因為他們靠漁網而富裕， 食物充足。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35001017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;難道他們要無休止地撒網， 無情地毀滅列國嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35002001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我要登上瞭望台， 站在望樓上守候， 看耶和華要對我說什麼， 我要怎樣向祂分訴。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35002002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;耶和華對我說： 「將我的啟示記下來， 清楚地刻在板上， 便於人們閱讀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35002003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;這啟示還未到實現之時， 它關乎結局，沒有虛假。 即使緩慢，也要等候， 因為這事終必發生，不再遲延。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35002004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;看那驕傲之人，他們心術不正， 但義人必靠信心而活。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35002005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;財富會欺騙驕傲之人， 使他們永不安分， 像陰間一樣貪得無厭， 如死亡一般永不滿足。 因此，他們征服萬國， 擄掠萬民。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35002006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;「但萬國萬民必用詩歌和俗語嘲諷他們，說， 『你們有禍了！ 你們吞沒別人的財產， 靠剝削別人囤積財富， 要到何時呢？』</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35002007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你們的債主必突然行動， 使你們戰戰兢兢， 淪為他們的俘虜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35002008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你們從前擄掠許多國家， 殺人流血， 摧毀他們的土地、城市和人民， 所以各國的餘民必掠奪你們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35002009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;「為自己的家積蓄不義之財、 在高處搭窩躲避災禍的人啊， 你們有禍了！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35002010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;你們陰謀毀滅各族， 以致自辱己家，自害己命。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35002011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;牆上的石頭必高聲控訴， 房子的梁木必同聲響應。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35002012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;「以人血建城邑， 以罪惡造城池的人啊， 你們有禍了！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35002013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;列邦的勞碌都化為灰燼， 列國的辛勞盡是虛空。 這不都是出於萬軍之耶和華嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35002014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;因為大地必充滿對耶和華之榮耀的認識， 如同海洋被水充滿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35002015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;「讓鄰居喝酒直到灌醉他們，好觀看他們祼體的人啊， 你們有禍了！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35002016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;你們必飽受羞辱，毫無榮耀。 你們喝吧，露出下體吧！ 耶和華右手中的杯將傳給你們， 你們的榮耀將變成羞辱。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35002017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;你們以暴虐對待黎巴嫩， 自己必被暴虐吞噬； 你們毀滅野獸， 自己必被恐怖籠罩。 因為你們殺人流血， 摧毀土地、城市和人民。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35002018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;「雕刻的偶像有什麼益處？ 騙人的鑄像有什麼用處？ 製造者竟信靠自己造的啞巴偶像！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35002019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;對木頭說『醒醒吧』， 對啞巴石頭說『起來吧』的人啊，你們有禍了！ 它們能教導你們嗎？ 看啊，它們外面包金裹銀， 裡面卻毫無生命。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35002020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;但耶和華住在祂的聖殿中， 世人都要在祂面前肅靜。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35003001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;以下是哈巴谷先知的禱告，採用流離調。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35003002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊，我聽過你的威名； 耶和華啊，我對你的作為充滿敬畏。 求你如今再次彰顯你的作為， 求你此時再次顯明你的作為， 求你發怒的時候仍以憐憫為念。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35003003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;上帝從提幔來， 聖者從巴蘭山來。（細拉） 祂的榮耀遮蔽諸天， 頌讚之聲響徹大地。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35003004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;祂明亮如晨光， 祂的手射出光芒， 其中蘊藏著大能。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35003005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;瘟疫行在祂前面， 災病跟在祂腳後。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35003006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;祂停下，大地就震動； 祂觀看，萬民就戰慄。 古老的山嶽崩裂， 遠古的丘陵塌陷， 但祂的作為永遠不變。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35003007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我看見古珊的帳篷遭難， 米甸的幔子顫抖。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35003008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊，你是向江河發怒嗎？ 你騎著馬、乘著得勝的戰車而來， 是向江河生氣嗎？ 是向海洋發怒嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35003009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;你張弓搭箭，要射出許多箭羽。（細拉） 你以江河分開大地。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35003010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;群山看見你就戰慄， 大水奔騰而過， 深淵鳴響，波浪滔天。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35003011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;你射出的箭閃閃發光， 你的槍熠熠生輝， 以致日月都停在原處。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35003012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;你懷著烈怒走遍大地， 帶著怒火踐踏列國。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35003013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你出來是為了拯救你的子民， 拯救你膏立的王。 你打垮邪惡之人的首領， 從頭到腳徹底毀滅他。（細拉）</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35003014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你用他的矛刺透其勇士的頭顱。 他們如旋風而至，要驅散我們， 他們喜好暗中吞噬貧民。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35003015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你騎馬踩踏洶湧的大海。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35003016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;我聽到這些， 就膽戰心驚，嘴唇哆嗦， 四肢無力，雙腿發抖。 但我仍要靜候災難臨到入侵者的日子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35003017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;即使無花果樹不發芽， 葡萄樹不結果， 橄欖樹無收成， 田地不產糧， 圈裡沒有羊， 棚裡沒有牛，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35003018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;我仍要因耶和華而歡欣， 因拯救我的上帝而喜樂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10035003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈巴谷書 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "35003019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;主耶和華是我的力量， 祂使我的腳如母鹿的蹄， 穩行在高處。 這首歌交給樂長，用弦樂器伴奏。</p>"
  }
]